cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or build on SHIPRTCL, please cite it as below."
title: "SHIPRTCL: Self-Healing Ingestion with Structural Fingerprints and Lazily Synthesized Mapping Rules"
abstract: "An open protocol for detecting structural drift in webhooks and API payloads and repairing it with value-independent structural fingerprints, a verifiable declarative mapping language, and privacy-bounded rule synthesis."
